PyLingual Portable
==================

This local build includes source code from PyLingual:
  https://github.com/syssec-utd/pylingual
  License: GPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE)

It also includes Python, PyTorch, Transformers, Tokenizers, NumPy, xdis,
safetensors, and other third-party packages. Their licenses are distributed
with the corresponding packages under runtime/python-3.15.1/Lib/site-packages.

Model weights are downloaded from Hugging Face repositories under
https://huggingface.co/syssec-utd. Refer to each model card for its license
and provenance. The statement models are declared Apache-2.0; the segmenter
model cards do not currently declare a license, so this build is intended for
personal, non-commercial use only and is not to be redistributed.
